1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,000
National Radio and Television Administration

2
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse.

3
00:01:34,759 --> 00:01:35,800
Don't worry about having no answers.

4
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:37,160
Worry about it not being difficult.

5
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,240
As long as you dare to ask,

6
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:40,000
Lawyer Qiu will give you the answer.

7
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,600
The trial today is a big case.

8
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:44,479
But I, Lawyer Qiu, am already well-prepared.

9
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,170
Shooting a skit?

10
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,600
Colleague.

11
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:54,120
Lawyer Qiu has such a strong sense of belief.

12
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,000
What is this?

13
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:56,120
Artist.

14
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,759
A born performing artist.

15
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,040
It's up to you now.

16
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:04,120
Good luck.

17
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,970
Thanks for your cooperation, Lawyer Qiu.

18
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,260
The victim's family is also here.

19
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,680
This is going to be tough.

20
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,880
Good luck, Lawyer Li.

21
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,760
The court is now in session.

22
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:43,480
Summon Shao Yinhai, Ma Benteng, and

23
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:45,760
the other five defendants to the court.

24
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,120
The defense will now present evidence to the court.

25
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:13,200
Regarding the crime of illegal detention.

26
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:15,040
The detainee claimed

27
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,840
to have been held by Shao Yinhai's subordinates

28
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:19,400
in an agricultural warehouse in the northern suburbs

29
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,760
for up to six hours.

30
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,640
However, the city's ring road was not yet open at that time.

31
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:25,920
The journey from the crime scene to the hospital

32
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:28,840
would take at least four and a half hours by car.

33
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,040
Therefore, we can infer

34
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:32,200
that the so-called illegal detention time

35
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:34,200
was even less than two hours.

36
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,120
Regarding the accusation against Shao Yinhai

37
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,800
for the crime of illegally occupying agricultural land,

38
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,680
the appraisal report submitted by the prosecution

39
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,360
has major flaws.

40
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:44,840
It only lists the data after the forest land was damaged,

41
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,900
but lacks the data before the damage.

42
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,520
And on page 31 of the appraisal report,

43
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:52,280
The same sub-compartment of forest land at the same coordinates

44
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,940
was simultaneously marked as

45
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,120
both a state-owned forest farm and collective forest land.

46
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:56,840
In summary,

47
00:03:57,120 --> 00:04:01,250
this appraisal report is insufficient to serve as a basis for the verdict.

48
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,440
Regarding the crime of intentional destruction of property,

49
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:04,360
this is a 2008 directive document

50
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,560
from the Feng'an Provincial Public Security Department.

51
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,840
The document states that

52
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:10,120
developing iron ore is a local policy.

53
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,560
For production safety,

54
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:14,680
each mining area must establish its own mine protection team.

55
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:17,800
The victim, Chen, entered the mining area to commit theft

56
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:20,600
and attempted to flee in a vehicle after being discovered.

57
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:23,880
To ensure the property safety of the mining area,

58
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:26,040
the mine protection team damaged his vehicle.

59
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:28,800
The defense argues that this action was a performance of duty,

60
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:31,200
not intentional destruction of property.

61
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:31,960
Ma Benteng,

62
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:33,720
your confession states that

63
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,880
you were instructed by Shao Yinhai that day.

64
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:37,880
and beat the victim to death, right?

65
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:38,600
Yes.

66
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,840
I called Chairman Shao for instructions before I did it.

67
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,700
Specific time?

68
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:45,480
Around 2:00 or 3:00.

69
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:48,000
According to the carrier's call records,

70
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,840
you only had one call with Shao Yinhai that day.

71
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:53,000
The time of the call was

72
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,440
2:58 PM.

73
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:56,120
And the surveillance video at the scene shows

74
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:57,680
the time you beat him was

75
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,600
3:12 PM.

76
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,400
Judging from the time on the surveillance video,

77
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,120
You did indeed

78
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,120
talk to Shao Yinhai on the phone

79
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,960
before beating the victim.

80
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:11,840
But what if the time on the video is wrong?

81
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,080
Your Honor,

82
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:19,080
we have obtained the complete surveillance video record.

83
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,740
The surveillance video shows

84
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,280
that the sunset time on that day was

85
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,720
19:25.

86
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:27,000
But we compared it with the Meteorological Bureau's records for that day.

87
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,400
The actual sunset time on that day was

88
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,880
18:25.

89
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:31,880
In other words,

90
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:34,560
the time on the video is

91
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,960
actually one hour later than the real time.

92
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,090
But unfortunately,

93
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:40,680
the prosecution failed to notice this error

94
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:44,120
and wrongly accepted Ma Benteng's statement.

95
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,560
So, counting backward from the exact time of sunset,

96
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:48,720
the actual time Ma Benteng committed the assault was

97
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,360
14:12,

98
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,320
which was before his phone call with Shao Yinhai

99
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:54,560
at 14:58.

100
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,880
Then I would like to ask,

101
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:58,680
how could my client have instigated the crime

102
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,880
after it had already happened?

103
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:01,840
Objection.

104
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:04,280
Based on other evidence in the case,

105
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:06,740
Ma Benteng had no grudge against the victim.

106
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,200
If it weren't for Shao Yinhai,

107
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:10,080
he wouldn't even have a motive for the assault.

108
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,280
As Shao Yinhai's subordinate,

109
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:13,840
receiving a salary far beyond normal,

110
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:17,080
he should have understood why he was hired at such a high price.

111
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:18,640
So he unscrupulously

112
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:21,200
helped Shao Yinhai settle various problems encountered

113
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:22,520
during the company's expansion.

114
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,640
His violent behavior

115
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:26,320
was in fact a manifestation of Shao Yinhai's will.

116
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:27,600
In judicial practice,

117
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:30,880
instigation must be supported by clear evidence.

118
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:32,760
Those so-called facts without evidence

119
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:35,400
and unverified by the judiciary

120
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,840
are merely assumptions

121
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:39,520
and should not be the basis for judging a case.

122
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:40,840
Legally,

123
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,400
facts without evidence

124
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:44,570
are considered non-existent.

125
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:46,840
But the provable fact is that

126
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,300
on the day of the incident,

127
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:50,280
Shao Yinhai, as the opening guest

128
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,640
of Leyang's most important

129
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:53,600
business conference that year,

130
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:55,280
gave a speech on stage

131
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:57,520
for half an hour.

132
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:59,720
He had absolutely no time to give orders.

133
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:03,200
Since then, the projects he undertook have contributed

134
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:06,080
3.562 billion in taxes to the country.

135
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,800
And the jobs he provided

136
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:10,760
supported 8,764 families.

137
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,600
Honorable Chief Judge and collegial panel,

138
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:17,160
my client should indeed,

139
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:20,360
for the illegal acts during the company's development,

140
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,800
bear criminal responsibility

141
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,360
and provide due compensation.

142
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,160
But his contribution to society

143
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,380
should not be ignored either.

144
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:30,650
So please take this into comprehensive consideration.

145
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:35,000
Regarding the eight charges brought by the prosecution,

146
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:37,200
we have no objection to the charges of picking quarrels and provoking trouble,

147
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:40,960
falsely issuing invoices, and illegal business operations.

148
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:43,520
The defendant pleads guilty and accepts the punishment.

149
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:44,520
The prosecution's charge of

150
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:47,040
illegal detention is unfounded.

151
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:49,960
The charges of intentional injury, intentional destruction of property,

152
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:51,520
illegal occupation of agricultural land,

153
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,200
and organizing and leading

154
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:54,080
a mafia-style organization

155
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,140
are unfounded.

156
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,040
Lawyer Li.

157
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,160
Your defense statement

158
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,240
sounds like what I said to Director Shao.

159
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,040
Yes.

160
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:21,520
The first time you said it,

161
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,250
I thought it made a lot of sense.

162
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,810
Pleasure working with you.

163
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:36,200
Lawyer Li, that speech just now was brilliant.

164
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,770
Scumbag lawyer!

165
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,240
Helping the wicked!

166
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,159
You have no morals! How can you be a lawyer?

167
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:42,120
I'm telling you, that's enough.

168
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:42,919
Do you even deserve to be a lawyer?

169
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:44,600
This is picking quarrels and provoking trouble, plus defamation.

170
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,040
I can hold you legally responsible.

171
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:47,000
Hold who responsible?

172
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,840
We lost a family member.

173
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:48,400
It's a human life!

174
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:49,800
Fine, I'm calling the police right now.

175
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:50,120
Wait.

176
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:50,800
Bowen.

177
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:51,480
Forget it.

178
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,800
Are you satisfied?

179
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:54,840
Satisfied? Satisfied with what?

180
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:57,640
A life is gone, what's there to be satisfied about?

181
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:00,900
You have no morals!

182
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,160
You don't deserve to be a lawyer.

183
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:03,480
You don't deserve to be a lawyer.

184
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,720
Have you no shame?

185
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:06,120
Have you no shame?

186
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,420
You have no morals!

187
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,720
You don't deserve to be a lawyer!

188
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,600
They are all so unreasonable.

189
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,260
We didn't do those bad things.

190
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:21,160
Witness, please state the facts of the case

191
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:22,240
as you know them.

192
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,280
At that time,

193
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:29,060
the head office had just been sealed off and things were a mess.

194
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,360
Zhou Huan instructed me

195
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:33,560
to transfer the 1.2 million in wealth management funds

196
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:35,800
all to my personal account.

197
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,120
I was against it at first.

198
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:41,400
But Zhou Huan kept coaxing me with sweet words,

199
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:43,650
saying how much he loved me,

200
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:46,170
and that he would definitely marry me.

201
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:47,800
He also said

202
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:51,920
that this type of crime wouldn't be punished heavily,

203
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:55,040
and you'd usually be out after two years in prison.

204
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:57,040
Once we got through this period,

205
00:09:58,040 --> 00:10:00,400
we would definitely live a happy life.

206
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,320
I believed him.

207
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:05,360
So I took all the blame for him.

208
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:08,200
Presiding Judge.

209
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,360
All rise.

210
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,360
Presiding Judge.

211
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:13,400
Presiding Judge.

212
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:16,560
According to the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China,

213
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:18,120
Article 176

214
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,120
and Article 272,

215
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:22,240
the judgment of this case is as follows:

216
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,360
The defendant, Zhou Huan,

217
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:26,000
is guilty of illegally absorbing public deposits

218
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,240
and misappropriating funds.

219
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,600
For these combined offenses,

220
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:31,000
he is sentenced to six years in prison

221
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:33,840
and fined 200,000 RMB.

222
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:37,610
The trial of this case is concluded. Court is adjourned.

223
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,440
The announcement about Jia Xin's fraud case

224
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,440
is out, isn't it?

225
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:51,080
Didn't it say the losses could be refunded?

226
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:51,720
Indeed.

227
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:54,200
After Jia Xin's assets were seized and liquidated,

228
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,760
it is indeed possible to proportionally

229
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,480
refund 90% to the public.

230
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,760
Didn't you lose 180,000?

231
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,080
You can get 162,000 back.

232
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:03,240
Then I just threw away 28,000 for nothing?

233
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,200
Who taught you math?

234
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,080
It's 18,000.

235
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,080
Isn't 18,000 still money?

236
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:09,240
18,000 is enough to renovate my storefront.

237
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:09,840
Then,

238
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,840
what about the 200,000 my mom was scammed out of before?

239
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,600
That belongs to another case.

240
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,720
It cannot be merged and handled together with this case.

241
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:16,080
True,

242
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,480
they are two cases,

243
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:19,440
but isn't the criminal the same person?

244
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:21,000
Mr. Dong, please calm down first.

245
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,440
The situation is like this.

246
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:24,240
All of Jia Xin's illegal income,

247
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:25,650
minus what he spent,

248
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,320
has already been used to repay

249
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,640
the victims of the financial fraud.

250
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:30,700
Currently, it's only enough for 90%.

251
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,000
What does that mean?

252
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,240
So if I sue him now,

253
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,840
I won't be able to get this money back, right?

254
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,480
Theoretically, yes.

255
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:41,440
Then I reported him for nothing.

256
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:43,480
And I even offended a bunch of gangsters.

257
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,210
Given your merit in reporting,

258
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:46,920
we will give you a reward.

259
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:50,240
See, I knew you wouldn't let me report for nothing.

260
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:52,120
Alright, what's the reward?

261
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:54,000
Min

262
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:55,000
Shi

263
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:55,320
Yang

264
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:55,640
Le

265
00:11:57,640 --> 00:11:59,120
Definitely.

266
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,820
You must trust the police.

267
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:05,080
Isn't this the young man who helped us?

268
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:05,840
It's you.

269
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,440
It's him.

270
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:09,640
It's my duty.

271
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:10,280
Thank you.

272
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:11,120
It's only right.

273
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,840
It's only right. It's only right.

274
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,000
Let's take a picture. It's only right.

275
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:14,840
Let's take a picture.

276
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,640
Thank you.

277
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,520
No need. Don't.

278
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:18,850
Don't push. Don't push.

279
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,080
Okay, okay.

280
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,000
Smile. Yeah.

281
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:31,240
Lawyer Xiao.

282
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:32,640
Knowing the regulations

283
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:34,720
of the detention center,

284
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:37,840
you intentionally played a recording to the detained client.

285
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,720
We hope you

286
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:41,440
can explain this violation.

287
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,320
I'm sorry.

288
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:47,530
I did violate the code of conduct for lawyers.

289
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:51,360
I am willing to accept the corresponding punishment.

290
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:54,100
President, what is your opinion?

291
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:01,640
I think the punishment for Lawyer Xiao

292
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:05,440
should consider both the hard rules of the industry

293
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,480
and the essential requirement

294
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:09,600
of practicing law,

295
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:13,240
which is to do one's best for the client.

296
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:14,640
I suggest

297
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:17,770
we follow the Justice Bureau's suspension penalty.

298
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:22,100
At its discretion, the Bar Association will not impose further punishment.

299
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,080
Master.

300
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:26,480
Master.

301
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:32,200
Thank you for speaking up for me just now.

302
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:35,320
It's been a long time since I heard you call me Master.

303
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:38,480
You've always been my Master in my heart.

304
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:42,540
Have you had enough of messing around out there?

305
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:46,080
Come back when your suspension is over.

306
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:47,600
Master.

307
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,080
I heard you say

308
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:54,960
that you used to work hard on your own

309
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:57,690
and built everything up little by little.

310
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:00,480
So I want to keep trying

311
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,600
and see if I can make it.

312
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,000
I understand.

313
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,410
Everyone has their own ambitions.

314
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:13,080
I hope you won't regret your choice today.

315
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,660
Take care, Master.

316
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:35,400
Sister.

317
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:37,280
We've been suspended for so long.

318
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:39,000
Our funds are running out.

319
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,720
We are not RISING JUSTICE at all.

320
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,800
We are going downhill.

321
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:48,810
Sister Wang.

322
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:49,800
Lawyer Xiao.

323
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,560
I went back to Tieling a few days ago.

324
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:52,560
I saw Wu Lian.

325
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:54,740
She told me to give this letter to you.

326
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,210
Sister Lian.

327
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:56,520
Yes.

328
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:57,880
Lawyer Xiao, I have things to do.

329
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:59,400
I have to go to work. I'll leave now.

330
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:00,280
Goodbye, Lawyer Xiao.

331
00:15:00,280 --> 00:15:00,880
Okay, take care.

332
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:02,240
Goodbye. Thanks for your trouble.

333
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:02,960
Take care.

334
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,960
Written by Sister Lian.

335
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:06,520
Quick, take a look.

336
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,760
Apples, 10 yuan.

337
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,240
Bread, 3 yuan.

338
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:27,360
Toothpaste

339
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:28,720
and toothbrush,

340
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:30,000
14.8 yuan.

341
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:32,960
Kettle, 26.9 yuan.

342
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,680
Medical bill, 47.2 yuan.

343
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:37,320
Filing a case, 10 yuan.

344
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,600
Lollipop, 0.5 yuan.

345
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,200
Helping me,

346
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:49,760
priceless.

347
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:18,480
This includes, but is not limited to...

348
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:21,160
And this arbitration clause must be strictly controlled.

349
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,480
Then I will follow your ideas

350
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,940
and come up with a new plan.

351
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:25,720
Come in.

352
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:28,840
Boss, Shao Yinhai's verdict is out.

353
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,240
All the gang-related charges were dropped.

354
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,640
In the end, he was sentenced for illegal business operations,

355
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:34,480
falsely issuing invoices, and picking quarrels and provoking trouble.

356
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,640
Due to his good attitude in pleading guilty,

357
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:37,200
he received a lighter sentence of six years and six months.

358
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:39,320
The financial penalty totals 2.5 million.

359
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,650
This is the best result.

360
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:41,810
Attorney Li.

361
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,840
Shanyuan and Baisi

362
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,680
want to schedule a meeting with us as soon as possible to come up with a plan.

363
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:46,440
Boss, you were really amazing this time,

364
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,570
turning the tables.

365
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:49,440
Everyone did a good job this time.

366
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:51,640
Feel free to ask for any reward you want.

367
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,370
What are you talking about?

368
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:54,840
Being able to learn from you

369
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:56,720
is the best reward for me.

370
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:59,440
So we are not just pretty faces anymore?

371
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:01,440
We are golden jade pillows.

372
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:04,260
Now you're bringing up cultural relics.

373
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:07,839
Boss, can I get a bonus?

374
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:08,839
Of course.

375
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,640
Same here.

376
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:10,440
No problem.

377
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:13,720
Well, what about me?

378
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,380
You continue to learn from me.

379
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:21,000
Not muting your phone at work will cost you your bonus.

380
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,260
I forgot to turn it off.

381
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,319
How did I end up losing money?

382
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:29,280
Did you guys hear?

383
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:31,010
Xiao Longnv got suspended.

384
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:02,760
Take care.

385
00:18:02,760 --> 00:18:03,440
Bye.

386
00:18:04,320 --> 00:18:04,960
I'm off.

387
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:07,890
Taking a shower?

388
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:10,600
I'll take a bottle of water. Put it on my tab.

389
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:11,240
Okay.

390
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:12,680
You're here, Xiaoxu.

391
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:51,930
So pretentious.

392
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:16,880
Xiaoxin,

393
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:19,240
come to my house for dinner tomorrow.

394
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:21,640
I have something to tell you. You must come.

395
00:19:23,080 --> 00:19:25,340
You three go ahead and eat. I'm not going.

396
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:27,520
Come on, why are you being so unreasonable?

397
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:29,000
I've already made plans with the two kids.

398
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:29,960
And the verdict is out.

399
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,490
I think the verdict is fair.

400
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,250
Now you understand the law?

401
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:35,960
Do you think I studied at Beichuan University for nothing?

402
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:36,720
The most important thing now is

403
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:38,240
for the two kids to make up.

404
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:40,560
And when they argued in the past,

405
00:19:40,560 --> 00:19:41,680
they'd be fine in two weeks at most.

406
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:44,540
But it's been a while this time. Aren't you worried?

407
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:45,780
Alright, alright.

408
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:47,040
I'll put up with it.

409
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:48,520
Yes, yes, you have to.

410
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,000
As long as they make up,

411
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:51,960
it also gives you a way out. Isn't that great?

412
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:53,160
I don't need a way out.

413
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:54,240
Right, you don't need it, you don't need it.

414
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:56,760
You're so stubborn. Come, come, come.

415
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:01,160
I'm just playing along with you.

416
00:20:01,560 --> 00:20:03,490
They're here, they're here. Come.

417
00:20:04,120 --> 00:20:05,050
Come, Xin, come.

418
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:06,720
Come in, come in. I'll put it here, Uncle.

419
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:08,040
Why did you buy these?

420
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:09,940
We have plenty at home.

421
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:11,720
No need to change shoes. No need to change.

422
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:13,120
Let him change his shoes.

423
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:18,650
You're quite observant today.

424
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:58,240
Hurry up. There's treasure inside.

425
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:06,240
There's a big sword over there.

426
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:07,700
Can you help me get it down?

427
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:12,240
A bit to the right.

428
00:21:12,560 --> 00:21:13,560
More to the right.

429
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:15,240
Did you get it?

430
00:21:15,320 --> 00:21:16,680
Got it.

431
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:21,760
Dad, I'm home.

432
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:26,480
Why are you here?

433
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:29,240
Xin is my guest.

434
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:31,410
Why do you invite just anyone home?

435
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:32,320
What are you talking about?

436
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:33,200
My name is on the deed.

437
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,680
Can't I invite guests?

438
00:21:35,120 --> 00:21:36,980
Hurry up and get ready for dinner.

439
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:40,880
Who told you to touch my things?

440
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,480
Keep your hands to yourself.

441
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:44,560
You still kept the big sword.

442
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:47,000
I threw it away.

443
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,680
But my dad picked it back up.

444
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,520
Because of one case,

445
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:57,560
you got suspended for so long.

446
00:21:57,560 --> 00:21:58,440
Was it worth it?

447
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:02,040
Pretty worth it.

448
00:22:02,560 --> 00:22:05,120
Yu Huihui's sentence was reduced from five years to two.

449
00:22:05,120 --> 00:22:06,680
And Zhou Huan got six years.

450
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:07,940
It's totally worth it.

451
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:09,800
If you don't change your temper,

452
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:12,330
your license will be revoked sooner or later.

453
00:22:12,520 --> 00:22:14,380
Stop worrying about my business.

454
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:17,810
Don't let it slip later.

455
00:22:18,080 --> 00:22:19,280
Keep your mouth shut.

456
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:21,010
Don't spill it everywhere.

457
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,570
Here, I'll do it myself.

458
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:27,920
Not too much.

459
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:40,720
Your Uncle Xiao

460
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:42,580
organized this gathering today.

461
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:44,520
He mainly...

462
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:49,000
mainly to celebrate my

463
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:52,380
glorious retirement of exactly ten months.

464
00:22:53,640 --> 00:22:54,880
Come on.

465
00:22:58,720 --> 00:22:59,960
Speaking of his retirement,

466
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:01,680
it reminds me of when I was young.

467
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:02,880
I never thought that one day

468
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:06,240
I could sit at the same table with Director Li...

469
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:07,000
Deputy.

470
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:08,480
Deputy Director Li,

471
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:11,000
to celebrate his retirement.

472
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:12,240
Ten months.

473
00:23:12,320 --> 00:23:13,320
What does this show?

474
00:23:13,320 --> 00:23:16,240
It shows that there's no hurdle you can't get over.

475
00:23:16,840 --> 00:23:17,920
What's a big deal?

476
00:23:18,480 --> 00:23:19,960
What's a big conflict?

477
00:23:24,360 --> 00:23:26,240
No, your dad means

478
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:27,720
our relationship used to be like that,

479
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:30,240
just like cat and mouse.

480
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:33,060
And now we can shake hands and make peace, right?

481
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:35,240
Yes.

482
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:35,880
Right?

483
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:38,720
You...

484
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:39,930
What you said...

485
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:41,720
Although your analogy is not very appropriate,

486
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:42,880
it makes sense.

487
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:44,560
What do you think, Xiaolong?

488
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:45,480
I say,

489
00:23:46,280 --> 00:23:47,960
who are you talking about?

490
00:23:49,520 --> 00:23:50,480
What is this?

491
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:51,920
I get it.

492
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:53,640
Hurry up and apologize to Xiaolong.

493
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:55,240
No need to apologize.

494
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:57,010
I understand what you mean.

495
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:58,240
But,

496
00:23:59,720 --> 00:24:00,560
he and I

497
00:24:00,560 --> 00:24:02,000
walk different paths.

498
00:24:02,080 --> 00:24:03,760
No, why are you still talking about paths?

499
00:24:03,760 --> 00:24:04,480
Xiaolong,

500
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:06,320
you know him well.

501
00:24:06,560 --> 00:24:08,800
I mean our backgrounds are different,

502
00:24:08,800 --> 00:24:10,480
and we have differences in principle.

503
00:24:10,480 --> 00:24:12,240
Xiaolong is not wrong.

504
00:24:12,480 --> 00:24:15,240
The basic thing about being a person is having a sense of right and wrong.

505
00:24:15,240 --> 00:24:17,440
You can't change your moral bottom line.

506
00:24:17,440 --> 00:24:18,440
Not even a little bit.

507
00:24:18,440 --> 00:24:19,200
Look at what Dad Li said.

508
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:21,400
No, you just shouldn't take some cases.

509
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:24,240
You're coughing so much.

510
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:26,200
Should I go buy you some medicine?

511
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:27,800
You shouldn't even be sitting here.

512
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:29,860
You forgot your original intention.

513
00:24:30,560 --> 00:24:33,480
Didn't you two play well together when you were kids?

514
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:34,160
Play well?

515
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:36,240
Didn't we fight the first time we met?

516
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:38,000
Isn't that how friendships start?

517
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:38,680
When was this?

518
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:39,480
Why don't I know?

519
00:24:39,480 --> 00:24:40,720
How would you know?

520
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:41,720
At that time,

521
00:24:41,720 --> 00:24:43,040
you were in prison.

522
00:24:43,040 --> 00:24:43,920
Where were you?

523
00:24:46,040 --> 00:24:49,480
I mean when Xiaolong came to the police station to find her dad,

524
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:51,440
I saw this little girl,

525
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:54,720
with big eyes and cute braids.

526
00:24:54,800 --> 00:24:56,480
If I had a daughter like that,

527
00:24:56,560 --> 00:24:58,560
I would never let her end up like this.

528
00:24:58,560 --> 00:25:00,000
Today is such a happy occasion.

529
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:02,320
Why are you talking about this?

530
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:04,220
Didn't you ask me to say it?

531
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:05,440
No.

532
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:06,760
Don't you know what to say

533
00:25:06,760 --> 00:25:08,240
and what not to say?

534
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:11,960
Do you have any emotional intelligence?

535
00:25:12,800 --> 00:25:14,680
Okay, I'll propose a toast.

536
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:16,760
Dad Li, Dad,

537
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:17,960
I'll drink first.

538
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:19,040
Take small sips.

539
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:20,480
You child, let me pour you some.

540
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:22,280
Stop, I'll just drink this much.

541
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,320
Thank you both.

542
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:26,240
For preparing this meal,

543
00:25:26,240 --> 00:25:27,600
you've gone to a lot of trouble.

544
00:25:27,600 --> 00:25:30,440
I don't want us to fail to make peace

545
00:25:30,440 --> 00:25:32,170
and have you two split up again.

546
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:34,160
Anyway, Li Xin and I...

547
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:37,160
From now on, we go our separate ways.

548
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:38,560
Enjoy your meal.

549
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:39,240
Don't... You...

550
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:39,680
I'm going back.

551
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:40,880
Come have some more to drink. Come on.

552
00:25:40,880 --> 00:25:41,320
You...

553
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:47,160
She's just like that.

554
00:25:47,160 --> 00:25:48,760
Xiaoxin, come, let's drink.

555
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:50,740
Come, let's drink.

556
00:25:50,800 --> 00:25:52,440
Godfather, Dad.

557
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:54,400
I actually have something to do.

558
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:55,640
I... I'll get going. Actually,

559
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:56,520
I'll drink water instead of wine.

560
00:25:56,520 --> 00:25:57,580
What are you doing?

561
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:58,240
You...

562
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:03,960
You haven't even...

563
00:26:03,960 --> 00:26:04,820
Take your time.

564
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:06,240
Wait, you haven't even eaten anything.

565
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:07,040
You...

566
00:26:11,440 --> 00:26:13,480
These kids, honestly...

567
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:14,720
This...

568
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:15,780
Wait, today you...

569
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:18,680
Are we still drinking this wine?

570
00:27:07,240 --> 00:27:08,900
Why did you call me down again?

571
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:16,480
What are you going to do during your suspension?

572
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:20,160
I have a friend

573
00:27:21,120 --> 00:27:22,680
who does bar exam training.

574
00:27:23,400 --> 00:27:24,680
If you have nothing to do recently,

575
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:26,340
you can help out as a lecturer.

576
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:28,340
If you don't have enough money...

577
00:27:29,440 --> 00:27:31,480
Stop worrying about my business.

578
00:27:33,600 --> 00:27:36,080
I'm just doing this as a friend.

579
00:27:36,080 --> 00:27:36,720
Friend?

580
00:27:37,360 --> 00:27:38,960
We are no longer friends.

581
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:42,060
Why are you so desperate for friends?

582
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:44,400
Let's go.

583
00:27:45,560 --> 00:27:46,040
Que.

584
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:52,640
Since I was a child,

585
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:56,010
you've been my only friend.

586
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:01,720
You are mighty, young hero.

587
00:28:01,720 --> 00:28:03,240
I am Xiao Longnü.

588
00:28:03,240 --> 00:28:05,400
May I know your name?

589
00:28:05,480 --> 00:28:06,720
I am Li Xin.

590
00:28:07,040 --> 00:28:09,320
Meeting by chance is fate.

591
00:28:09,840 --> 00:28:12,720
From today on, we are friends.

592
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,000
All right.

593
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:41,800
Let the past be the past.

594
00:28:45,920 --> 00:28:47,780
If you still consider me a friend,

595
00:28:48,680 --> 00:28:51,000
I hope you can respect my choice.

596
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:54,440
I never lost to you when we were in Honghu,

597
00:28:54,920 --> 00:28:55,480
did I?

598
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:57,400
Now that I'm out,

599
00:28:57,400 --> 00:28:59,000
I will definitely go all out.

600
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:01,640
I really don't want to win too easily.

601
00:29:04,280 --> 00:29:05,000
Okay.

602
00:29:06,280 --> 00:29:08,000
If we meet in court,

603
00:29:08,920 --> 00:29:10,320
I will show no mercy.

604
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:29,840
Mr. Liu, slow down.

605
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:30,730
Are you okay?

606
00:29:31,040 --> 00:29:32,680
I'll go open the door.

607
00:29:32,760 --> 00:29:33,360
Slow down.

608
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:34,880
How do I open the car door?

609
00:29:35,560 --> 00:29:36,090
Let's go.

610
00:29:36,120 --> 00:29:36,780
Have a seat.

611
00:29:37,800 --> 00:29:40,240
Mr. Liu, so we have a deal.

612
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:41,720
When my suspension is over,

613
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:43,760
can you give me a chance, Mr. Liu?

614
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:47,080
Straightforward.

615
00:29:47,080 --> 00:29:47,560
Okay.

616
00:29:51,080 --> 00:29:52,560
Mr. Liu can't handle it either.

617
00:29:52,560 --> 00:29:54,080
Yeah.

618
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:56,880
I bet he won't remember anything tomorrow.

619
00:29:57,480 --> 00:29:58,920
Then the money was wasted.

620
00:29:58,920 --> 00:29:59,160
Then your money wasn't wasted.

621
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:01,280
Then your money wasn't wasted.

622
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:03,730
Are you okay?

623
00:30:04,200 --> 00:30:05,730
What could be wrong with me?

624
00:30:06,480 --> 00:30:07,720
No, you...

625
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:12,000
You can't hold it anymore.

626
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:12,920
No, sis.

627
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:16,100
I'll get you some tissues. No, no, no, water.

628
00:30:17,560 --> 00:30:19,490
Drink some honey water to sober up.

629
00:30:25,280 --> 00:30:26,920
Drink slowly.

630
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:30,850
Feeling better?

631
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:32,960
No.

632
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:35,260
Look at you after drinking this much.

633
00:30:35,320 --> 00:30:36,000
Here.

634
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:37,680
This month's salary.

635
00:30:38,680 --> 00:30:40,520
No. I didn't do anything this month.

636
00:30:40,520 --> 00:30:41,480
Our law firm hasn't had any business.

637
00:30:41,480 --> 00:30:42,280
Why would I need a salary?

638
00:30:42,280 --> 00:30:43,240
What do you mean, no?

639
00:30:43,240 --> 00:30:44,400
Just take it when I give it to you.

640
00:30:44,400 --> 00:30:45,480
Don't argue with me.

641
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:46,360
You and... you and...

642
00:30:46,360 --> 00:30:48,280
Don't make your parents worry.

643
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:53,280
It's still my fault, really.

644
00:30:53,280 --> 00:30:54,440
I dragged you down.

645
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:57,160
What do you mean dragged me down? It's nothing.

646
00:30:58,200 --> 00:31:00,760
There's something I've always wondered about.

647
00:31:00,760 --> 00:31:03,040
You were working at Honghu,

648
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:05,040
stable and respectable.

649
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:06,960
Why did you insist on coming out to work with me,

650
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:08,620
facing all this uncertainty?

651
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:10,320
Sis,

652
00:31:11,080 --> 00:31:12,960
do you remember how we met?

653
00:31:17,080 --> 00:31:20,200
I had just joined Honghu back then.

654
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:22,330
Good morning, Mr. Wang.

655
00:31:22,960 --> 00:31:24,720
Hot latte, Tao.

656
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:25,480
Thank you.

657
00:31:26,520 --> 00:31:27,450
Iced Americano.

658
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:28,560
Here are your documents.

659
00:31:28,560 --> 00:31:30,820
I'll bring you the second version later.

660
00:31:30,880 --> 00:31:31,600
Hey, you.

661
00:31:32,120 --> 00:31:33,760
Go downstairs and get a package for me.

662
00:31:33,760 --> 00:31:35,000
Okay, right now.

663
00:31:39,840 --> 00:31:40,680
Hey, you.

664
00:31:41,080 --> 00:31:43,340
Wipe the whiteboard in the meeting room.

665
00:31:45,040 --> 00:31:48,440
At that time, I was used to being a nobody,

666
00:31:48,520 --> 00:31:51,720
a little beast of burden without even a name.

667
00:31:58,520 --> 00:32:00,680
The client has been sitting in the meeting room for a long time.

668
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:03,080
They don't even have a glass of water, and you're sleeping here.

669
00:32:03,080 --> 00:32:04,040
I'm sorry.

670
00:32:04,760 --> 00:32:06,000
I'll go get some now.

671
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:08,200
No need. I've already taken the scolding for you.

672
00:32:08,200 --> 00:32:10,000
You don't need to come tomorrow.

673
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:38,520
Gu Miaomiao.

674
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:45,600
What's wrong?

675
00:32:46,040 --> 00:32:48,280
That day you called out my name

676
00:32:48,720 --> 00:32:50,720
and stood up for me.

677
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:51,360
Attorney Xiao.

678
00:32:51,360 --> 00:32:54,000
Why does your department fire people just like that now?

679
00:32:54,000 --> 00:32:54,480
What's wrong?

680
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:56,320
Look at Gu Miaomiao's attendance.

681
00:32:56,320 --> 00:32:58,000
She comes more often than you do.

682
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:59,040
At least we are

683
00:32:59,040 --> 00:33:00,360
Honghu's HR.

684
00:33:00,360 --> 00:33:02,160
You should review the labor law.

685
00:33:02,920 --> 00:33:05,040
It was the first time I felt seen.

686
00:33:10,120 --> 00:33:12,000
What do you mean by being seen?

687
00:33:12,280 --> 00:33:14,360
Those who can't see you are blind.

688
00:33:14,560 --> 00:33:15,360
What invisible person?

689
00:33:15,360 --> 00:33:16,360
Remember this.

690
00:33:16,720 --> 00:33:18,360
No one is invisible.

691
00:33:18,480 --> 00:33:21,040
We are all the main characters of our own lives.

692
00:33:21,040 --> 00:33:21,800
Understand?

693
00:33:21,800 --> 00:33:22,600
Understood.

694
00:33:24,520 --> 00:33:27,040
To me, you are really amazing.

695
00:33:27,200 --> 00:33:29,680
You'd go through fire and water.

696
00:33:30,840 --> 00:33:33,480
Anyway, I will support you in whatever you do.

697
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:35,280
To me, you are the best.

698
00:33:37,600 --> 00:33:38,520
Thank you.

699
00:33:42,040 --> 00:33:45,040
Let's try to take on a few major cases

700
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:47,570
and make our law firm bigger and stronger.

701
00:33:47,680 --> 00:33:51,210
From now on, you'll be the administrative director of our firm.

702
00:33:52,600 --> 00:33:53,600
Director Miao.

703
00:33:54,040 --> 00:33:55,000
Director Miao.

704
00:33:57,560 --> 00:33:59,240
I'll change my contact name right now.

705
00:33:59,240 --> 00:34:01,360
I'll change it to Director-in-waiting.

706
00:34:01,360 --> 00:34:03,020
Okay, Director-in-waiting.

707
00:34:05,360 --> 00:34:06,760
It's almost twelve o'clock.

708
00:34:06,760 --> 00:34:07,520
Hurry, hurry.

709
00:34:07,520 --> 00:34:08,520
I can't drink anymore.

710
00:34:08,520 --> 00:34:09,040
No, no.

711
00:34:09,040 --> 00:34:10,280
I really can't drink anymore.

712
00:34:10,280 --> 00:34:12,280
Just come with me. Hurry up.

713
00:34:12,280 --> 00:34:12,960
Where are we going?

714
00:34:12,960 --> 00:34:14,199
Hurry up.

715
00:34:14,199 --> 00:34:14,730
Let's go.

716
00:34:17,920 --> 00:34:19,050
Run a little faster.

717
00:34:27,120 --> 00:34:27,719
Sis.

718
00:34:28,080 --> 00:34:30,280
Today is the last day of our suspension.

719
00:34:31,440 --> 00:34:32,080
Look.

720
00:34:32,880 --> 00:34:43,080
Ten, nine, eight, seven, six, five, four, three, two, one.

721
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:48,320
Xiao Longnv Law Firm is reopening.

722
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:52,880
Congratulations on the opening.

723
00:34:56,239 --> 00:34:57,800
A fresh start.

724
00:35:01,240 --> 00:35:02,240
We'll be fine.

725
00:35:02,240 --> 00:35:03,240
Trust me.

726
00:35:04,000 --> 00:35:05,000
Definitely.

727
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:08,880
RISING JUSTICE.

728
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:15,330
What's going on?

729
00:35:45,560 --> 00:35:46,080
Come in.

730
00:35:47,080 --> 00:35:47,960
Mr. Li.

731
00:35:48,600 --> 00:35:50,760
Here are the resumes of the intern lawyers to be interviewed today.

732
00:35:50,760 --> 00:35:51,320
Please take a look.

733
00:35:51,320 --> 00:35:51,680
Okay.

734
00:35:55,960 --> 00:35:56,560
Mr. Li.

735
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:58,080
The first one is Wang Ruoqi.

736
00:35:58,080 --> 00:35:59,610
She is our boss's daughter.

737
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:02,040
What do you think?

738
00:36:04,080 --> 00:36:05,040
I got it.

739
00:36:05,560 --> 00:36:06,440
Okay, Mr. Li.

740
00:36:06,440 --> 00:36:08,840
I won't bother you. Go ahead with your work.

741
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:14,040
Hello, lawyers. I am Wang Ruoqi.

742
00:36:14,120 --> 00:36:15,840
I graduated from Xiangjiang University.

743
00:36:15,840 --> 00:36:17,120
My major is Chinese law.

744
00:36:17,120 --> 00:36:18,840
I have passed the bar exam.

745
00:36:19,160 --> 00:36:20,960
It's an honor to study at Honghu.

746
00:36:21,200 --> 00:36:23,260
An outstanding graduate of Jiangda.

747
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:26,680
Mr. Li, she's your junior.

748
00:36:28,040 --> 00:36:28,560
Your GPA

749
00:36:28,560 --> 00:36:29,400
is quite good.

750
00:36:29,600 --> 00:36:30,120
Why is your PCLL

751
00:36:30,120 --> 00:36:31,000
so low?

752
00:36:31,800 --> 00:36:34,000
That's why I came to Honghu for an internship.

753
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:35,760
I still want to get more practical experience

754
00:36:35,760 --> 00:36:37,320
to make up for my shortcomings as soon as possible.

755
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,000
Ruoqi.

756
00:36:39,000 --> 00:36:41,360
I see your grades in corporate law

757
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:42,760
are quite good.

758
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:45,120
Then come to our team.

759
00:36:45,760 --> 00:36:46,920
Sorry, Mr. Shen.

760
00:36:47,680 --> 00:36:50,280
I want to join Mr. Li's team.

761
00:36:50,840 --> 00:36:52,120
Last time, I had the honor of hearing

762
00:36:52,120 --> 00:36:53,600
Mr. Li's closing argument in court.

763
00:36:53,600 --> 00:36:55,280
I thought it was absolutely brilliant.

764
00:36:55,280 --> 00:36:56,280
Look, look, look.

765
00:36:56,280 --> 00:36:58,810
Ruoqi has such high emotional intelligence.

766
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:01,520
But I have a question for Lawyer Li.

767
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:05,040
The offer from Juncheng in Hong Kong

768
00:37:05,040 --> 00:37:05,520
is notoriously

769
00:37:05,520 --> 00:37:07,160
hard to get.

770
00:37:07,520 --> 00:37:09,760
Why did you give it up after getting it

771
00:37:09,760 --> 00:37:11,360
and choose to come to Honghu?

772
00:37:14,280 --> 00:37:15,040
Is the offer from Honghu

773
00:37:15,040 --> 00:37:16,000
easy to get?

774
00:37:18,440 --> 00:37:20,920
There is a probation period for the intern lawyers I train.

775
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:23,320
You can only stay officially if you pass it.

776
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:26,000
No problem. I love challenges.

777
00:37:31,600 --> 00:37:32,440
What is this?

778
00:37:32,760 --> 00:37:35,090
Sister, step over it to get rid of bad luck.

779
00:37:35,280 --> 00:37:35,880
Miao.

780
00:37:35,880 --> 00:37:37,880
We shouldn't be so superstitious.

781
00:37:39,280 --> 00:37:40,610
Left foot or right foot?

782
00:37:40,680 --> 00:37:41,360
Left foot.

783
00:37:41,360 --> 00:37:42,040
Left foot.

784
00:37:42,040 --> 00:37:43,280
Come, hold this for a second.

785
00:37:43,280 --> 00:37:44,280
Let me get ready.

786
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:44,760
Slow down.

787
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:46,000
One, two, three, go.

788
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:49,520
Safe landing, good luck.

789
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:50,880
Taking off.

790
00:37:51,040 --> 00:37:52,500
Quite a sense of ceremony.

791
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:56,760
What's wrong?

792
00:37:56,920 --> 00:37:58,050
Did you sleep wrong?

793
00:37:59,480 --> 00:38:00,480
Very flexible.

794
00:38:00,480 --> 00:38:01,760
What do you want to do?

795
00:38:02,200 --> 00:38:04,280
I believed your nonsense before

796
00:38:04,360 --> 00:38:05,560
and went undercover.

797
00:38:05,680 --> 00:38:08,400
As a result, my family's 200,000 yuan went down the drain.

798
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:10,040
Shouldn't I settle this score with you?

799
00:38:10,040 --> 00:38:10,920
Dong Beihu.

800
00:38:10,920 --> 00:38:12,280
Don't act like a rogue in our law firm.

801
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:13,920
I'll record you for evidence.

802
00:38:13,920 --> 00:38:15,450
How do you want to settle it?

803
00:38:17,160 --> 00:38:18,160
How?

804
00:38:22,640 --> 00:38:24,500
Then give me half of this law firm.

805
00:38:25,080 --> 00:38:27,880
Mr. Dong, do you want to cut it horizontally or vertically?

806
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:29,680
I mean give me half of the shares.

807
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:31,280
You definitely can't afford to pay me back.

808
00:38:31,280 --> 00:38:32,800
Let's just say that 200,000 yuan is my investment.

809
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:35,200
Your abacus beads are practically hitting my face.

810
00:38:35,200 --> 00:38:36,000
You do nothing,

811
00:38:36,000 --> 00:38:37,080
and I work for you?

812
00:38:37,080 --> 00:38:38,640
What do you mean I did nothing?

813
00:38:38,640 --> 00:38:40,000
If it weren't for me in your last case,

814
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:41,460
could you have succeeded?

815
00:38:42,440 --> 00:38:45,570
Okay, I admit you deserve credit for catching Zhou Huan.

816
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,840
How about this?

817
00:38:48,400 --> 00:38:49,000
I happen to have

818
00:38:49,000 --> 00:38:51,080
an open position here.

819
00:38:51,200 --> 00:38:52,280
Think about it.

820
00:38:52,360 --> 00:38:53,280
What position?

821
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:55,290
Marketing Specialist.

822
00:38:55,560 --> 00:38:57,360
How big is this place to have a whole department?

823
00:38:57,360 --> 00:38:58,160
Weren't you also

824
00:38:58,160 --> 00:38:59,520
a middleman for cases before?

825
00:38:59,520 --> 00:39:00,520
What do you mean by middleman?

826
00:39:00,520 --> 00:39:02,200
That was legal service consulting.

827
00:39:02,200 --> 00:39:04,320
You can call it a superpower if you want.

828
00:39:04,320 --> 00:39:05,960
Anyway, that's how it is.

829
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:07,720
You need money, and I need cases.

830
00:39:07,720 --> 00:39:09,640
You can just work for me steadily

831
00:39:09,640 --> 00:39:12,000
and get paid by performance. How about it?

832
00:39:13,360 --> 00:39:15,760
If you put it that way, it's not impossible.

833
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:17,280
Then when a case is successful in the future,

834
00:39:17,280 --> 00:39:17,960
we split it fifty-fifty.

835
00:39:17,960 --> 00:39:18,920
Fifty-fifty?

836
00:39:19,160 --> 00:39:20,560
Do you know how long it takes me to handle a case?

837
00:39:20,560 --> 00:39:21,440
And you want fifty-fifty?

838
00:39:21,440 --> 00:39:22,000
Eighty-twenty.

839
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:23,120
Eighty for me, twenty for you.

840
00:39:23,120 --> 00:39:23,920
You're crazy.

841
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:25,640
Do you think it's easy for me to bring in a case?

842
00:39:25,640 --> 00:39:26,400
Sixty-forty.

843
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:28,000
Do you think it's easy for me to fight a lawsuit? Eighty-twenty.

844
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,520
Twenty sounds bad. Seventy-thirty.

845
00:39:29,520 --> 00:39:31,080
If you're going to talk like this, it's no fun.

846
00:39:31,080 --> 00:39:31,960
You're not sincere at all.

847
00:39:31,960 --> 00:39:33,000
You're the one who's not sincere.

848
00:39:33,000 --> 00:39:34,000
If you talk like this, I'm leaving.

849
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:34,760
Go ahead.

850
00:39:34,760 --> 00:39:35,490
I'm leaving.

851
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:36,600
Don't call me back.

852
00:39:36,600 --> 00:39:38,130
Who are you trying to scare?

853
00:39:38,320 --> 00:39:39,400
I'm really leaving.

854
00:39:39,400 --> 00:39:41,240
Go. The door is over there. Hurry up.

855
00:39:41,240 --> 00:39:42,300
Don't call me back.

856
00:39:46,320 --> 00:39:47,360
You're quite persistent.

857
00:39:47,360 --> 00:39:48,160
I appreciate that.

858
00:39:48,160 --> 00:39:49,000
Honestly.

859
00:39:49,280 --> 00:39:50,280
Let's sign the contract.

860
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:51,080
What contract?

861
00:39:51,080 --> 00:39:52,000
This is a legitimate law firm.

862
00:39:52,000 --> 00:39:53,000
There's a probation period.

863
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:54,480
Bring in a case first.

864
00:39:56,440 --> 00:39:57,480
Okay, it's a deal.

865
00:39:58,080 --> 00:40:01,410
You two will get a discount when you go downstairs for a bath.

866
00:40:02,240 --> 00:40:03,370
Should we thank you?

867
00:40:03,480 --> 00:40:04,480
For the discount.

868
00:40:05,600 --> 00:40:06,360
Sis.

869
00:40:07,680 --> 00:40:10,760
If he really brings in a case, are we really going to use him?

870
00:40:10,760 --> 00:40:11,920
We'll cross that bridge when we come to it.

871
00:40:11,920 --> 00:40:14,320
Life is full of surprises. Who knows?

872
00:40:15,200 --> 00:40:16,520
Good citizen.

873
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:18,960
Good citizen.

874
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:20,690
Alright, alright, put it away.

875
00:40:20,840 --> 00:40:23,280
See that? Our status is different now.

876
00:40:24,200 --> 00:40:25,960
Not only am I a good citizen,

877
00:40:26,440 --> 00:40:29,480
I've also been successfully promoted from the boss of a legal consulting firm

878
00:40:29,480 --> 00:40:32,400
to the marketing director of a law firm.

879
00:40:33,040 --> 00:40:34,160
That's not right, bro.

880
00:40:34,160 --> 00:40:35,200
Why does it sound like

881
00:40:35,200 --> 00:40:36,640
you got demoted instead of promoted?

882
00:40:36,640 --> 00:40:37,800
Shut up.

883
00:40:38,040 --> 00:40:39,520
Do you know what a law firm is?

884
00:40:39,520 --> 00:40:41,880
A law firm means having lawyers.

885
00:40:41,880 --> 00:40:43,680
Once we integrate these resources,

886
00:40:43,680 --> 00:40:45,960
all services will be a one-stop shop.

887
00:40:46,040 --> 00:40:47,080
So from now on,

888
00:40:47,200 --> 00:40:49,080
whether it's a big case or a small case,

889
00:40:49,080 --> 00:40:50,080
a major case or a crucial case,

890
00:40:50,080 --> 00:40:52,360
as long as you have a case, push it to me.

891
00:40:52,360 --> 00:40:53,080
Got it?

892
00:40:53,080 --> 00:40:54,080
Got it, got it.

893
00:40:54,200 --> 00:40:56,330
If you're in trouble, go to Brother Hu.

894
00:40:56,600 --> 00:40:57,120
Go to Brother Hu.

895
00:40:57,120 --> 00:40:58,400
Come, come, come.

896
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:07,640
Ma'am, this is my business card.

897
00:41:07,640 --> 00:41:08,520
Here you go.

898
00:41:08,720 --> 00:41:10,200
Ask around on this street.

899
00:41:10,200 --> 00:41:12,040
Everyone knows what I'm capable of.

900
00:41:12,040 --> 00:41:13,880
There's no lawsuit I can't win.

901
00:41:15,840 --> 00:41:16,360
Ma'am, ma'am.

902
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:17,600
No, cases like yours,

903
00:41:17,600 --> 00:41:18,600
I've handled so many.

904
00:41:18,600 --> 00:41:19,920
It's a piece of cake, really.

905
00:41:19,920 --> 00:41:21,980
Just tell me if you have any concerns.

906
00:41:22,160 --> 00:41:23,040
Understood, understood.

907
00:41:23,040 --> 00:41:23,960
It's about the price, right? Hey!

908
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:24,880
The price is negotiable.

909
00:41:24,880 --> 00:41:25,920
No need. Look, ma'am.

910
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:26,720
You even sent a pennant.

911
00:41:26,720 --> 00:41:28,080
No win, no fee, okay?

912
00:41:28,120 --> 00:41:30,050
I'll get angry if you do this again.

913
00:41:30,480 --> 00:41:30,720
Take care.

914
00:41:30,720 --> 00:41:32,250
It's really not necessary.

915
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:33,440
Didn't I just

916
00:41:33,520 --> 00:41:36,080
bravely break into a criminal gang alone

917
00:41:36,080 --> 00:41:37,920
and save a group of elderly people?

918
00:41:37,920 --> 00:41:39,400
I would've forgotten if you hadn't mentioned it.

919
00:41:39,400 --> 00:41:41,200
This is what our Xiaolongnü Law Firm

920
00:41:41,200 --> 00:41:42,200
is supposed to do.

921
00:41:42,400 --> 00:41:44,920
Yes, our firm can handle any lawsuit.

922
00:41:45,360 --> 00:41:47,120
Lawyer Xiao is definitely the light of the city,

923
00:41:47,120 --> 00:41:48,800
the embodiment of justice, the nemesis of evil,

924
00:41:48,800 --> 00:41:50,640
and she especially helps the elderly.

925
00:41:50,640 --> 00:41:52,160
Okay, alright, alright.

926
00:41:52,160 --> 00:41:53,420
I won't thank you here.

927
00:41:53,520 --> 00:41:54,520
You're too kind.

928
00:41:55,520 --> 00:41:57,720
Ma'am, is there anything I can help you with?

929
00:41:57,720 --> 00:41:58,680
Young man.

930
00:41:59,440 --> 00:42:00,960
Someone owes me money.

931
00:42:01,240 --> 00:42:02,570
How much do they owe you?

932
00:42:11,360 --> 00:42:12,890
Pack up, let's get off work.

933
00:42:17,160 --> 00:42:18,520
Did you drive in?

934
00:42:20,080 --> 00:42:20,920
Nobody leave.

935
00:42:21,320 --> 00:42:22,250
We got a big case.

936
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:23,920
Let's work hard and do some overtime.

937
00:42:23,920 --> 00:42:25,320
Really?

938
00:42:25,320 --> 00:42:27,040
You actually got a big case after all this time?

939
00:42:27,040 --> 00:42:28,000
I'm surprised too.

940
00:42:28,000 --> 00:42:29,400
The case came right to me.

941
00:42:29,760 --> 00:42:31,520
Every profession produces its own top expert.

942
00:42:31,520 --> 00:42:33,560
What big case, top expert?

943
00:42:36,160 --> 00:42:37,160
Three people?

944
00:42:37,640 --> 00:42:39,000
Guess the amount.

945
00:42:39,160 --> 00:42:39,760
30,000?

946
00:42:40,640 --> 00:42:41,370
Guess again.

947
00:42:41,840 --> 00:42:43,320
300,000?

948
00:42:43,400 --> 00:42:44,360
Think bigger.

949
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:46,920
3,000,000.

950
00:42:48,480 --> 00:42:50,680
Let's work overtime. I'll call them in.

951
00:42:52,000 --> 00:42:53,930
You brought the God of Wealth here.

952
00:42:55,120 --> 00:42:56,040
Welcome.
